@startuml layer-component
' AI-generated draft. Not reviewed. Not rendered: PlantUML was unavailable when authored.
title SplitSmart layers and components (proposal)\nThe Swing MVP does NOT satisfy CR-10. OC-1 is open pending written acceptance.

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "com.splitsmart.app" as app {
  component "SplitSmartApp\n(composition root, AD-01)" as Root
}

package "com.splitsmart.ui (Swing, on EDT; ID-03)" as ui {
  component "Panels\nLoginPanel, RegisterPanel, HomePanel,\nGroupListPanel, GroupDetailPanel,\nExpenseFormPanel, ExpenseDetailPanel, ReceiptViewerDialog,\nPendingApprovalsPanel, BalancesPanel, GroupBalancesPanel,\nPaymentFormPanel, PaymentHistoryPanel,\nNotificationsPanel, ReportPanel, MainFrame" as Panels
  component "Controllers\nSessionController, GroupController, ExpenseController,\nApprovalController, BalanceController, PaymentController,\nNotificationController, ReportController" as Controllers
  component "UiTaskRunner\n(SwingWorker)" as Runner
}

package "com.splitsmart.service (no GUI types)" as service {
  component "Service interfaces and Default* implementations\nAccountService, GroupService, ExpenseService,\nApprovalService, BalanceService, PaymentService,\nNotificationService, ReportService" as Services
  component "AccessPolicy\nFR-003, NFR-003" as Access
  component "LedgerReader\nNotificationDispatcher\nPasswordHasher\nExpenseDraftValidator\nFieldFormats" as Helpers
}

package "com.splitsmart.domain (JDK only, no GUI types)" as domain {
  component "Entities\nUser, Group, Membership, Expense,\nApprovalDecision, Payment, Notification" as Entities
  component "Value objects\nMoney, Percentage, Share,\nLedgerEntry, ..." as Values
  component "Pure calculators\nSplitAllocator, BalanceCalculator,\nReportCalculator" as Calculators
}

package "com.splitsmart.repository (no GUI types)" as repository {
  interface "Repository interfaces\nand TransactionRunner" as RepoApi
}

package "com.splitsmart.repository.jdbc" as jdbc {
  component "JDBC implementations\nFR-040, NFR-005" as Jdbc
}

database "Embedded H2 file\n(AD-07 proposal)" as H2

Panels --> Controllers : events
Controllers --> Runner : schedule
Runner --> Services : off-EDT call
Controllers --> Values : read-only values
Services --> Access
Services --> Helpers
Services --> Entities
Services --> Calculators
Services --> RepoApi
Helpers --> RepoApi
Access --> RepoApi
Jdbc ..|> RepoApi : implements
Jdbc --> Entities : maps
Jdbc --> H2 : SQL
RepoApi --> Entities
Entities --> Values
Calculators --> Values

Root ..> Panels : constructs
Root ..> Services : constructs
Root ..> Jdbc : constructs

note top of service
  Authorization and input parsing live here, reached from every UI action.
  FR-003: a user sees only their own groups and related data.
end note

note bottom of domain
  Forbidden everywhere except ui: javax.swing, java.awt, javax.imageio.
  AD-22 enforces this. Principle III.
end note

note right of ui
  Gathers input, calls services, renders results.
  No business rules or balance calculations.
end note

note as PostMVP
  **Post-MVP. Not designed or built here:**
  FR-009 archive groups
  FR-018 external notifications
  FR-025 multi-level approval
  FR-038 saved reports and export
  FR-039 web browser access (OC-1)
  A future web client would call the service layer in place of ui.
  It is not authorized and not part of this design.
end note

@enduml
